{"title":"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/27790cd3d73657777c8acdffc733d36aba72f71c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; a &lt; b &lt; c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359274a1114ef8b749d26f2653a62f2ce2fa6b23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - 1)(b -1)(c - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" /> is a divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6ebccc43472a464fafbbef33099ee14bba049991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bf52c375793dcf220f426c6d3aaa836c1882744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}&lt;\\frac{abc}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"391\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d83ecbba9eb310add00535455bc97e026fc425a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}&lt;\\left(\\frac{a}{a-1}\\right) \\left(\\frac{b}{b-1}\\right) \\left(\\frac{c}{c-1}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"441\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>With <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/45215533de7e69fa3ef41bd468a3b15c02dce068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;a&lt;b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> it implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2cd546ffbb52fe8a7f8e4d1cb3ec38047627e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e486f30ca8576f95b60e20db1cb1ac4afb651ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009b70de53545febf789ed693b84315854c63b58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\ge 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f883a09f7bf2ed96a6a679e16794d385cb881fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{a-1}=1+\\frac{1}{a-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>which for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> gives: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/4/6646aa016b754adc32f06d3ef16847f718400562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{a-1} \\le 1+\\frac{1}{2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" />, which gives&#160;:<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8d1a0c2290dbbcb87f7702c171081e3d1f322c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{a-1} \\le 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> gives: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4fe4e7c1b644dc48aa5193f58f2cfaf38956301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{b-1} \\le 1+\\frac{1}{3-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"145\" height=\"41\" />, which gives&#160;:<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82fae4a7ae785863d77e4aca70ac382457d7c47c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{b-1} \\le \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"82\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> gives: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f8066aeb258125bd95da05abec94ae37830c7078.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c}{c-1} \\le 1+\\frac{1}{4-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"145\" height=\"40\" />, which gives&#160;:<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d3ff2ccc634bf9c7e4584a6c4219e88ca37f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c}{c-1} \\le \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Substituting those inequalities into the original inequality gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba3725f814de9370e13a0071dcc26fc23c63c256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}&lt;\\left( 2 \\right) \\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right) \\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"333\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a6fcc29cb9a8834c501dc16b566336ea6a24de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"234\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84adf4f3275e0ce5269a43b3244c927d605e2e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"167\" height=\"44\" /> needs to be integer,\n</p><p>then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036961b0ad98661663198a09b41f19549a23b806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"201\" height=\"44\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc3a9c04b46188a3b39d130758313779f5c6519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"201\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036961b0ad98661663198a09b41f19549a23b806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"201\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/d/bdd4489873928ee55e9806edb245720883bc6381.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc-1=2(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)=2abc-2(ab+bc+ac)+2(a+b+c)-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"599\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Case 1, subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b577897ebee33c16e09a8151d3d303120df86c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2bc-1=2bc-2(b+c)+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"20\" /> gives: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f69b088ec2da382f53432bde7a57c859cc1d34b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(b+c)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> which has no solution because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/32688df2896754d3c8ca0e595c717f9c47c10745.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(b+c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> is even.\n</p><p>Case 1, subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b15f8908907d8cd859d2eecd04e1cb2d847828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3bc-1=4bc-4(b+c)+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcde662d660ecbdb3cd3652542a69550e10921d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc-4b-4c+5=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/1697438a442c90f42427efad8a0620f497ad5037.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-4)(c-4)=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/95738840d60a9ff2f4a315cfc47b2cb39db1dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-4=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/a/99a03a384b58e6d8ac6543520dfb3713f71e426e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-4=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> provides solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b725a5646597dc9d2dce7ef4615d780558b64e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(3,5,15)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc3a9c04b46188a3b39d130758313779f5c6519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{abc-1}{(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"201\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf6f373eb7d3a13dcae12772c5330c354ad355e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc-1=3(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)=3abc-3(ab+bc+ac)+3(a+b+c)-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"599\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Case 2, subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b22959ed199b49c3adc54f29b8cb0d06919e8cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2bc-1=3bc-3(b+c)+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/b/d7beeb1112f4abb480b3f0010e0b2f1f96cd3b1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc-3b-3c+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b702f90d93ff6c7446f42a0f792830d3dcc0985b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-3)(c-3)=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e072b362e7a7d7b45502f93d4a955b77b356f35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-3=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/3/033056950d07ef956819810b93077ea10add9041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-3=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> provides solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/6/5063f61fe1a23b639594354e3d555bf88e78d909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(2,4,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Case 2, subcase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/c/1ac68fe58b30720491cda53738ed84fc89a9624b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3bc-1=6bc-6(b+c)+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e086d9febdc5aa99e8b27ce193a5c8b0fad48e67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3bc-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" />) mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a1bc58de0dc5b0f00f841ccfaea82b0a95b5841.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/a/f0adad85e293aeab85b360d1fe7c60e7af978ff0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6bc-6(b+c)+6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06c5ad9cae378446c0c23b90a4408e7bdf6de075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, then there is no solution for this subcase.\n</p><p>Now we verify our two solutions:\n</p><p>when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/6/5063f61fe1a23b639594354e3d555bf88e78d909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(2,4,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7f9ddff43d1eff331e335792e7d353ed97b2c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc-1=(2)(4)(8)-1=63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"226\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8c5caa9ab5a69b0c4cdeb93f2262575db63059.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)=(1)(3)(7)=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"300\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, this solutions is correct.\n</p><p>when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b725a5646597dc9d2dce7ef4615d780558b64e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(3,5,15)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/3107f06811f234c497c7390943c9b9fae064ca2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc-1=(3)(5)(15)-1=224$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"244\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b697f533848edcc55953f3b2d393cdd605ce3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-1)(b-1)(c-1)=(2)(4)(14)=112$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"318\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd3907e89ce5b06f13d78589b5d92624a8b41a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$112$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/00000117d679c285532c25fd0d5129a728ca4653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$224$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, this solutions is also correct.\n</p><p>The solutions are: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/6/5063f61fe1a23b639594354e3d555bf88e78d909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(2,4,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b725a5646597dc9d2dce7ef4615d780558b64e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(3,5,15)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~ Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e47777d4212c54386590834ce77f14758a1617c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a-1, y = b-1, z = c-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"18\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81fc94e71343923e762f6a9cf8964c40f0d7ef66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq x &lt; y &lt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"17\" />. We're asked to solve\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/c/5fcba706fbae484fb0ee375ea4a7b3073b56a6e1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(k+1)xyz = (x+1)(y+z)(z+1)-1\\]\" width=\"303\" height=\"18\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a non-negative integer.. Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57d8fef9329fabd73078ae824a034e8a00e332f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"11\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/ddaf88541c5277b0a5e320b022c670757bb61bc7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} k+1 &amp;= \\Big(1+\\frac{1}{x}\\Big)\\Big(1+\\frac{1}{y}\\Big)\\Big(1+\\frac{1}{z}\\Big) - \\frac{1}{xyz} \\\\     &amp;&lt; (1+1)\\Big(1+\\frac{1}{2}\\Big)\\Big(1+\\frac{1}{3}\\Big) = 4 \\end{align*}\" width=\"317\" height=\"83\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/4/f24824287ffd32e444ea9c099055ac68187fc96f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=0,1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Simplifying the first equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d518d3669e061bb4ec79358754f35bc52ef24b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[kxyz = xy + yz + zy + x + y + z.\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/d/badf0ecd1ef8289387d8462393438c6e2710ff28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> is impossible. Case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f681bd84648c174d45eed0037702cae77ed0686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />: if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21cd6b8937bb07478e903e0186b41beefded34b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, dividing the previous equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa78bbd9d7b4f4a52731f4b160c50a09b0e7602.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align} 2z &amp;= 1 + \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + z\\Big(\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{xy}\\Big) \\\\    &amp;\\leq 1 + \\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3} + z\\Big(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{6}\\Big) \\\\    &amp;&lt; 2 + z \\nonumber \\end{align}\" width=\"404\" height=\"105\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b4dc707dfda00b9477f75a063393c4761c7bedb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> which is impossible. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> its easy to show <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> leads to a contradiction. Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b2456aa5394f7205f0906aa1983d723e410a046d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z = 2 + \\frac{5}{y-2}\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"41\" />\nwhich can only work if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/b/b0bc3891ab5ca3428b12210221abe2377778b889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3, z = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdb38c4272101ace54c4863db548c3190777d25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1,y=3,z=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"17\" /> is a solution. Case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed8470bc717a49aafe4556c7e2c2e11ddc7b687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />: considering the version of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> on the LHS instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/612cb53032b6b7359a67ad3d622a6b2208728afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2z$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> then \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c9f5941cbb55e31a3ee8b362ec103df9811a9de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} z &amp;= 1 + \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + z \\Big(\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{xy}\\Big) \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (3) \\\\    &amp;= 2 + \\frac{1}{y} + z\\Big(1+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{xy}\\Big)  \\end{align*}\" width=\"406\" height=\"87\" />\nwhich is impossible. Similarly to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d83346814f3ed26dc1b3139c475facfd3be607fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> then \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/6/726b8a47706126e6f5b4ade7bbdc794433c7a5c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z \\leq 1 + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} + z \\frac{8}{12}\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"37\" />\ni.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/a/12a6bafcd83039bef9c3fb9fbee57f30babe8b03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &lt; 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> which is impossible since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c7749806ddd0cbdbd24402403fa067c7cf228cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\leq x &lt; y &lt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"17\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9daae14b5b405ddb48edf93530f06ec53c51b6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Its easy to show <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b0e1404de4eca35c42876bcc83707b753e990e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> leads to a contradiction. Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/7202d22b75c865b30e70003c3d0d428a3626632e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z = 3 + \\frac{11}{y-3}\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"40\" />\nwhich can only work if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86bf0e334712a8655ce6e4e1b1e0138450d79a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4, z=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f553814899a2a6c50d41c6734dbeb3844521ad19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2,y=4,z=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"17\" /> is a solution. Our two solutions give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a9732b03306047360f6a989656fbbe5e050ded8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2,b=4,c=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/b/60b96f7d74262158cf78d5d5ff95115f45cb3013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3,b=5,c=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~not_detriti\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO\" title=\"1992 IMO\">1992 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183415\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 592/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1211/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 20852/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.259      1 -total\n 49.72%    6.593      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n 49.21%    6.525      1 Template:IMO_box\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15588:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183415 and revision id 253968. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}